"versions to avoid potential disruption. If you have already upgraded to "
"v10.5.0 or v10.5.1, we recommend updating the Jira plugin to version "
"v4.2.1, or preferably, upgrading both Mattermost and the Jira plugin to "
"their latest available versions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/important-upgrade-notes.rst:695
msgid ""
"The internal workings of the `PluginLinkComponent` in the web app have "
"been changed to unmount link tooltips from the DOM by default, "
"significantly improving performance. Plugins that register link tooltips "
"using `registerLinkTooltipComponent` will experience changes in how "
"tooltip components are managed—they are now only mounted when a link is "
"hovered over or focused. As a result, plugins may need to update their "
"components to properly handle mounting and unmounting scenarios. For "
"example, changes were made in `mattermost-plugin-jira "
"<https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-plugin-jira/pull/1145>`_, where"
" componentDidUpdate lifecycle hook was replaced with componentDidMount. "
"If your plugin’s tooltip component is a functional React component, there"
" is a high chance that this behavior will be handled automatically, as it"
" would be managed by useEffect with an empty dependency array."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/important-upgrade-notes.rst:702
