"database anymore. Therefore the database version is not going to be "
"printed. Also, the database migrations are not going to be applied with "
"the version sub command. :ref:`A new db migrate sub command "
"<administration-guide/manage/command-line-tools:mattermost db migrate>` "
"is added to enable administrators to trigger migrations."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/important-upgrade-notes.rst:1484
